    "access": "Wulugul Walk is fairly level and 3.8 m wide, with stair-free access up to Waranara Terrace and Stargazer Lawn. Lifts link Nawi Cove, Waranara Terrace and Stargazer Lawn to the car park. The Towns Place entrance starts with 30 m of brick and cobbles.",
